### Terraform ###

# Terraform working directory
.terraform/
**/.terraform/*

# Terraform state files
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*

# Terraform crash logs
crash.log
crash.*.log

# Terraform plan files
*.tfplan
*.tfplan.json

# Variable files - may contain sensitive values
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json

# Terraform override files
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Terraform CLI configuration
.terraformrc
terraform.rc

# Terraform temporary files
*.tf.tmp